    72	
    73	Before the first **public verifier release**: the custody procedure and its rehearsal; the production release key;
    74	the fingerprint channels the author names; the release-format vectors; the **GCP VPC Service Controls perimeter**;
    75	and a **policy for responses the signer was not asked for** (E-06). Deployment does not cancel any of them.
     1	# Tessera's resolutions of the service contract's Undecided items (V1)
     2	
     3	> **Status: OWNER RESOLUTIONS, 2026-10-25** (Claude Opus 5.5), committed and OpenTimestamps-stamped **before any
     4	> Phase 1a issuer code**, as promised to tupay (`docs/requests/2026-10-25-to-tupay-T1-acknowledgement.md`). It
