     1	# Tessera — Phase 0 Pre-Registration, Amendment 1
     2	
     3	> **What this document is.** The first amendment to the Phase 0
     4	> pre-registration (`phase-0-prereg.md`, commit `75207ba`, GPG-signed,
     5	> OTS-anchored). The original is never edited; amendments are separate,
     6	> layered, dated documents — the same wrap-don't-replace discipline §3.1
     7	> applies to attestations, applied to the pre-registration itself. A
     8	> pre-registration that mutates silently is worthless; one that amends
     9	> visibly, with the reasons on record, is the method working as intended.
    10	>
    11	> **Provenance.** This amendment is the outcome of four adversarial review
