   278	  (22-byte prefix `308207b2300b0609608648016503040312038207a100`, then the 1952-byte key); anything else is
   279	  `KEY_FORMAT` (RFC 9881 §§2, 4). Its fingerprint is §3.3's `spki-sha256`, unchanged. Key-use assumption (K-R) of
   280	  the supplement replaces PROOF (K) for this slot; the supplement carries both definitions.
