   361	
   362	| Group | Vectors | Codes |
   363	|---|---|---|
   364	| Anchor codec (14) | XH-01 to XH-14: truncated (3308), trailing (3310), slot length ±1, empty, two signatures, ML-DSA-44 and ML-DSA-87 sizes, wrong-slot rules both ways, slots swapped, ML-DSA under the classical id, base64 text, unknown id above the opaque cap | `SIG_FORMAT`, `LENGTH_CAP`, `SIG_EMPTY` |
