   216	
   217	*"We should preserve the concrete four-field envelope and the signer
   218	specific semantic bindings _if_ an explicit encoding map demonstrates
   219	both requirements. We should settle the map before format freeze
   220	because neither field count alone gives us an answer."*
   221	
   222	**Instrument.** A1 §A1.2 P8's four-field signed frame and A5 §A5.4's
   223	seven signer-specific bindings (object type, algorithm, identity,
   224	manifest hash, canonicalization version, payload, key fingerprint) are
