   192	## A5.5 P7: the wrapper's recorded inner canonicalization version must be true — ADOPTED (author)
   193	
   194	P7 says the wrapper "records both inner and outer canonicalization
   195	versions"; the review (item 18) showed a lying record is accepted.
   196	Registered: the verifier checks the wrapper's recorded inner version
   197	against the inner frame's own canonicalization-version field and
   198	rejects on mismatch; a lying-wrapper companion must go red. The
